WEBVTT

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:06.510
<i>The first time I saw the spirit was when</i>

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:09.990
<i>I went to the amusement park during summer 
break with Miho-chan and the others.</i>

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:12.110
<i>She was atop the diving board.</i>

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.080
She's shouting something.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:20.150
<i>I couldn't hear her voice.</i>

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:23.000
She's gone.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:25.800
Say cheese!

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:32.510
<i>But she must have had something 
she really wanted to say.</i>

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:35.510
<i>She didn't give up trying 
to communicate with people.</i>

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:38.130
Sakura-chan, let's take a picture.

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:40.930
Say cheese.

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:43.750
Look!

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.940
So that rumor's true.

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:49.890
That you can always get a 
spirit photo at this pool.

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:52.870
Want to take another picture?

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:54.030
No way!

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:57.330
<i>She tries so hard.</i>

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:33.000
It's Not a Date!

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.290
Mamiya Sakura.

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:41.260
No, this isn't...

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:45.010
Never mind.

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:50.590
<i>I shouldn't go asking Rinne 
every time I see a spirit.</i>

00:02:50.590 --> 00:02:51.640
Mamiya-san.

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:56.360
Is something wrong?
Why not talk to me?

00:02:58.600 --> 00:02:59.960
Tsubasa-kun.

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:05.290
You should wear a hat. 
You'll get heat stroke in this weather.

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:09.250
Hey, a little sunshine 
won't stop me helping you.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:11.670
Whoa, what?

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:13.900
Tsubasa-kun?

00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:19.450
It's hot.

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:22.590
It's so hot, Rinne-sama.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:25.840
I'm about to get heat stroke.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:28.580
Shut up. Our guest is enduring it too.

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:30.640
So, um...

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:34.840
You were on a date at the amusement park, 
and you went into the haunted house.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:35.660
Yes.

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:43.860
Haunted House

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:43.860
50% off
for couples

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:39.710
It was half-off for couples. 
We couldn't help ourselves.

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:43.860
It was just like any other 
dull haunted house inside.

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:50.750
But come to think of it now, that's when 
my boyfriend started acting like this.

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:52.280
<i>He's...</i>

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:54.930
<i>It's like his soul's been sucked out.</i>

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:02.800
Rokudou Rinne-sama,
 I have important information.
 I will be waiting for you in 
front of the haunted house.
 -Ageha the Shinigami

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.620
<i>I have important information.</i>

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:04.820
<i>I will be waiting for you in 
front of the haunted house.</i>

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:06.220
<i>Ageha the Shinigami</i>

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:09.350
<i>Important information?</i>

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:12.190
Spirit photos, you say?

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:17.110
Well, like half of my photos 
end up having spirits in them,

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:19.900
but never anything like this.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:20.480
Look.

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:22.010
<i>Oh, man!</i>

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:24.710
<i>This is...</i>

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:25.310
See?

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:27.330
Isn't it weird? This symbol.

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:29.620
You're right.

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:31.860
That's peculiar.

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:34.000
Rokudou Rinne-sama,
 I have important information.
 I will be waiting for you in 
front of the haunted house.
 -Ageha the Shinigami

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:34.000
All right.

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:36.000
This calls for...

00:04:36.390 --> 00:04:38.000
This calls for...

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:41.510
A trip to the amusement park.

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:52.140
I'm so glad to be alive!

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:58.020
What's wrong, Tsubasa-kun?

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:00.610
N-No... It's n-nothing.

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:01.650
Look, see?

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.830
Mizuki Rina...

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:09.030
How are you all doing?

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:11.400
A bound spirit.

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:14.790
Your mic seems to be broken.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:18.170
Jeez, you're right.

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:20.290
Thanks for telling me.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.380
Here, handshake.

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:23.840
This is just for you.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:33.310
Mizuki Rina <3

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:28.990
Whoa.

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:30.840
It's like in the photo.

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:33.310
Is this supposed to be an autograph?

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:35.570
I'm Mizuki Rina!

00:05:35.570 --> 00:05:37.810
Welcome to my event!

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:41.590
Damn, there's <i>actually</i> a spirit in it.

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:46.560
Rumor has it that a new idol was 
supposed to hold her debut event here,

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:49.450
but she died in an accident on her way here.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.630
So she's a lingerie model.

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:53.210
No mistake.

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:53.950
She's...

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:57.450
an evil spirit!

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:58.590
Holy Ash!

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:03.970
You're a bound spirit; 
you have nowhere to run.

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:05.670
Prepare to be purified.

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:07.720
What is this stuff?

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:09.240
Gross!

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:10.930
What is this? Sand?

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:16.760
How could you do that?

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:19.600
All those people were here for me!

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:21.680
I don't think so.

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:22.910
How could you?!

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:27.590
You ruined my debut event!

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:30.800
She left.

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:34.310
I guess she wasn't a bound spirit.

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:43.530
So this is the haunted house.

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:45.330
50% off for couples!

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:46.910
That's cheap, let's go!

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:48.920
Rinne, over here!

00:06:57.530 --> 00:06:59.100
Why are you trying to leave?

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.850
I didn't come here to play with you.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:04.440
This is work, Rinne.

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:08.490
This haunted house has 
ties with the Damashigami.

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:09.450
What?

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:12.030
And they're after couples this time.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:16.710
So we have to go in 
pretending to be a couple!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.300
Fair enough, I guess.

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:22.040
I'm pretty sure there are plenty 
of other ways to do this.

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:24.290
<i>Then...</i>

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:32.820
What is it?

00:07:32.820 --> 00:07:33.910
Nothin'.

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:34.790
Let's go.

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:39.600
<i>I want to know.</i>

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:45.360
<i>What was I feeling?</i>

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:48.360
<i>Thump-thump, thump-thump.</i>

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:50.900
Are you here alone?

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:53.450
You'll have to pay full price. 500 yen.

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:55.820
500 yen?!

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:57.300
Oh, I forgot.

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:00.760
<i>La-di-da, tada!</i>

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:02.770
<i>Allow me to explain.</i>

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:05.710
<i>Ageha the Shinigami is 
invisible to most people,</i>

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:09.710
<i>but she can show herself 
by switching her ribbon.</i>

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:11.490
For two.

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:12.590
I have tickets.

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:14.680
Here, an annual pass.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:18.240
Oh, sorry about that. Go ahead.

00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:16.830
<i>A year pass?!</i>

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:18.240
<i>You princess!</i>

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.880
Let's go, Rinne.

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:26.010
One couple coming through.

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:33.000
Mamiya-san.

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:35.310
Perfect.

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:37.250
I've been following the spirit's trail.

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:41.430
There's a good chance that 
the idol spirit hid in there.

00:08:45.780 --> 00:08:49.360
<i>First the pool, now a haunted house! Combo!</i>

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:51.670
<i>The stars have aligned!</i>

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:54.250
No, I'm so scared.

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:56.800
I'm here for you.

00:08:57.840 --> 00:09:00.870
<i>We'll be an actual couple 
by the time we leave!</i>

00:09:06.530 --> 00:09:08.670
I'm so scared!

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:10.970
I'm here for you.

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:12.810
No!

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:14.550
It's all right.

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:16.320
Don't let go!

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:16.730
Okay.

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:22.290
There's nothing out of the ordinary so far.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:24.580
And the props are pretty shabby.

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:27.820
Of course.

00:09:27.820 --> 00:09:31.020
Mamiya-san's not afraid of these things.

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:39.050
<i>She looks so nice in a yukata!</i>

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:47.600
It's...

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.120
Real?!

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:51.480
He ran off.

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:54.030
Let's go, Mamiya-san.

00:09:57.270 --> 00:10:01.660
<i>I'm casually holding hands with Mamiya-san!</i>

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:04.540
<i>Hooray for haunted houses!</i>

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:07.510
<i>I hope this never ends!</i>

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:13.540
Tsubasa-kun.

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:18.340
<i>It seemed like his spirit was 
half-disembodied for a second just now.</i>

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:21.930
Whose is that?

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:24.930
It's Sakura-sama.

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:27.490
<i>Why is she alone with Jumonji?</i>

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:29.450
What are you going to do?

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:34.940
He's on a date with Sakura-sama 
while you're just standing around.

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:36.820
<i>A date.</i>

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:43.150
That aside, Jumonji's spirit was 
just about to leave his body.

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:44.250
Was it?

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:47.200
You didn't do that to help him?!

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:50.660
Are you okay, Tsubasa-kun?

00:10:54.560 --> 00:10:56.090
There you are!

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.990
Tsubasa-kun, look.

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:01.090
Another real one?!

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:05.450
Be careful, something's after us.

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:07.860
It might be that idol's spirit.

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:11.870
Mamiya-san?

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:12.830
Mamiya-san!

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:13.480
What?!

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.130
Rinne-sama!

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:17.270
Rinne-sama!

00:11:17.270 --> 00:11:18.320
There you are.

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:19.620
You're terrible, Rinne.

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:20.610
How could you leave me?

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.410
Oh, dear.

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:25.660
<i>Sparkle.</i>

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:27.540
What the hell?!

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:31.000
Rinne-sama!

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:50.640
It's just us, Rinne.

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:53.500
No one will get in our way here.

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:54.530
Wait.

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:56.520
What about the investigation?

00:11:56.910 --> 00:12:00.530
Rinne, I've learned an important secret.

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:04.160
An important secret?

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:07.530
One of the couples I saw when 
we lost each other earlier...

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:10.140
I'm so scared.

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:12.570
Come hither.

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:17.640
Just as he was in bliss, 
his spirit left his body.

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:21.080
In other words, it's triggered 
by having dirty thoughts!

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:24.120
I'm so scared.

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:26.800
Come here.

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:29.310
<i>It left.</i>

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:31.930
<i>All those spirits.</i>

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:35.300
<i>Strings?</i>

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.020
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:46.710
So, like, if you have dirty 
thoughts about me, like,

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:51.160
we should find the Damashigami 
wherever your spirit ends up.

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:53.540
Ageha.

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:55.140
Come, Rinne!

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:56.420
What do you mean, "come"?!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:57.550
Just come!

00:12:57.550 --> 00:12:58.680
Hey!

00:12:58.680 --> 00:12:59.610
Let go!

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:00.540
Voices?

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:04.850
Mamiya Sakura.

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:08.740
Rokudou-kun.

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:11.470
Not good.

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:17.150
Sorry for interrupting.

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:18.490
Wait!

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:21.570
Hold on, Mamiya Sakura.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:27.580
Wait!

00:13:27.580 --> 00:13:28.730
Rinne.

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:30.950
How could you leave me behind?

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:33.250
Get in my way, and you'll be gone!

00:13:33.610 --> 00:13:36.350
Shinigami tool, Tombstone Maze!

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:42.140
<i>The Shinigami tool, Tombstone Maze,</i>

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:47.830
<i>is a terrible weapon that traps 
an enemy in a sea of tombstones.</i>

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:48.930
Where are you?

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.600
Where are you, Mamiya-san?

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:54.740
<i>But user beware, 
or you'll be trapped as well.</i>

00:13:55.420 --> 00:13:56.520
Crap!

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:00.150
I'm completely lost.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:06.830
<i>But this could be a good opportunity to 
find Mamiya Sakura and talk to her alone.</i>

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:08.280
Holy Ash!

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.260
Rokudou-kun.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:18.410
Mamiya-san!

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:20.920
You.

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:24.820
So you guys were here too, huh?

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:26.690
This is an undercover investigation.

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:28.380
It's totally not a date.

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:31.200
To prove it, we found out what's going on.

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:36.180
This haunted house takes the 
spirits of couples in bliss.

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:38.520
It targets dirty thoughts.

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:40.400
<i>Dirty thoughts?</i>

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:41.760
No wonder.

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:46.840
That's true. It was right when I held 
my girl close that I got taken away.

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:52.310
So you were having dirty thoughts 
about that Ageha girl earlier?

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:56.000
Whether you trust me or not is up to you,

00:14:56.600 --> 00:15:01.790
but it's obvious from how I behave 
daily what kind of man I am.

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:03.380
Good grief.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:06.670
If only it were so easy to 
convince your girlfriend.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:10.000
It's pulling me away!

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:12.330
Sheesh.

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:14.970
Where did Rinne go?

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:18.160
Weird.

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:20.940
Are they stuck somewhere?

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:24.940
Just when Rinne and I were getting close!

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:28.150
How could you mess it up, you Damashigami?!

00:15:28.850 --> 00:15:30.150
Shinigami.

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:41.290
Now I can have some quiet time with Rinne.

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:43.420
Huh?

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:45.180
The strings snapped.

00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:46.660
It's not pulling on me anymore.

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:48.050
Whatever was pulling on them was defeated.

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:50.980
Could it be Tsubasa-kun?

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:55.270
Rokudou-kun, let's go to where 
the string was pulling them.

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:57.220
Wait, I'm not done talking.

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.440
Rokudou's here, too?

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:01.590
That hobo! Why?

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:03.430
He's here on work!

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:05.630
So why are you here?

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:10.070
A spirit we saw a the pool fled 
this way, so we came after it.

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:12.320
What about you, Rokudou-kun?

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:14.610
At first, it was a request 
from the weather box.

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:18.080
Then I learned that there's 
apparently Damashigami here.

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:19.850
Yeah?

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:23.450
<i>So that's why he came here with her.</i>

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:26.320
<i>Normally he'd at least let me know.</i>

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:28.650
<i>A spirit at the pool?</i>

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:31.870
<i>Did she try to get Jumonji's help with it?</i>

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:38.100
<i>Oh yeah, that model spirit at the pool...</i>

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:41.040
Exit

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:40.050
Where did she go?

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:46.390
I'm Mizuki Rina.

00:16:46.390 --> 00:16:47.640
Nice to meet you.

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:49.880
Would you like a signature?

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:52.830
How about a handshake?

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:54.000
A signature?

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:55.640
Thanks for coming today!

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:57.070
Would you like a picture?

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:58.330
A signature?

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:04.470
There's a cute idol approaching 
you in a swimsuit.

00:17:07.010 --> 00:17:09.630
How could you ignore me?!

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:17.590
Isn't that...

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:19.430
Isn't that...

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:20.720
Mamiya-san.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:21.970
Rinne.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:24.390
There you are!

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.350
A power outage?

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:28.980
Rinne, this way.

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:31.400
Mamiya-san's scream.

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.320
Are you okay?

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:35.210
Ow...

00:17:35.210 --> 00:17:36.730
That voice.

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:37.770
Rokudou-kun?

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:44.490
<i>Yay!</i>

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:46.010
<i>Mamiya-san!</i>

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:48.090
<i>Rinne's so bold!</i>

00:17:50.870 --> 00:17:52.210
Their spirits.

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:53.230
They left.

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:01.330
Rokudou-kun, did you see that?

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:03.450
The Damashigami are still here.

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:04.310
Let's go, Mamiya Sakura.

00:18:04.690 --> 00:18:05.810
Yeah.

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.510
No, I don't think so.

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:15.000
Huh? Weird, I thought I got them.

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:18.070
Hello.

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:22.550
<i>And then we asked that 
spirit what was going on.</i>

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:26.290
I'm so unpopular.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:32.250
Just for once in my life, I wanted to 
come to the amusement park with someone.

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:35.590
But I died before I could make that happen.

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:41.090
Maybe I couldn't let go; I ended 
up coming to this haunted house.

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:44.940
I'd get jealous every time 
I see a lovey-dovey couple.

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:48.450
So I was messing with them.

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:51.100
So that's what led to all this.

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:52.020
And the Damashigami?

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:53.370
Damashigami?

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:56.940
Oh, my fishing buddies?

00:18:56.940 --> 00:19:02.120
I was here fishing, and they said they 
wanted to join, so I said, "sure."

00:19:04.680 --> 00:19:06.400
My name is Mizuki Rina.

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:08.960
How are you?

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:10.210
What is this?!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:11.880
That voice... could it be?

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:13.470
My ears!

00:19:13.470 --> 00:19:14.880
It's so loud!

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:22.580
Why won't you look at me?!

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:26.010
If that's the case...

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:27.140
Stop!

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:28.730
Rokudou-kun.

00:19:29.990 --> 00:19:32.860
Get out of my way.

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:39.420
Look at me, everyone!

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:43.890
I want an autograph.

00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:51.500
<i>That's right, Rokudou-kun, 
she just wants to be noticed.</i>

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.630
An autograph? All right.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:55.970
This way, everyone.

00:19:56.900 --> 00:19:59.860
Form a line here.

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:02.570
My glasses!

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:04.070
I just had them made!

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:05.640
My glasses!

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:09.020
I have so many fans.

00:20:09.490 --> 00:20:13.450
They're all looking at me and smiling.

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:17.930
I'm so happy.

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:23.400
Thanks, everyone.

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:25.640
It looks like she's content.

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:27.910
Yeah, she can pass on now.

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:33.510
Huh?

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:34.830
Isn't she going to pass on?

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:38.420
She got attention, though.

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:42.630
Now I just have to show up on 
variety shows, release an album,

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:45.430
sing the closing song at 
Kouhaku, debut in the US,

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:50.960
land a role in a Hollywood movie, and 
be known to everyone around the world!

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:52.300
She has more ambitions!

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:54.060
And they're excessively huge!

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:56.010
You can do it.

00:20:58.330 --> 00:20:59.120
Who's that?

00:21:01.050 --> 00:21:02.370
It's that guy.

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:03.700
From the haunted house.

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:07.620
Weren't you at the 
hand-shaking event earlier?

00:21:09.190 --> 00:21:11.860
I never had the courage to talk to you,

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:16.270
but I've been watching you 
trying really hard at the pool.

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:22.980
It'll suck that you'll be out of my 
reach, but this is my last chance.

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:29.260
<i>I knew it, he's totally my type.</i>

00:21:29.900 --> 00:21:34.270
Sorry, everyone, I'm retiring.

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:44.280
<i>And so Mizuki Rina the ghost idol</i>

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:48.700
<i>made a shocking transition with the 
spirit of the haunted house.</i>

00:21:52.970 --> 00:21:57.210
I guess it's a happily-ever-after?

00:22:02.980 --> 00:22:04.810
I'm so tired.

00:22:05.210 --> 00:22:08.260
I hugged Mamiya-san!

00:22:08.900 --> 00:22:14.090
As much as it was an accident,
I will have to take responsibility!

00:22:14.090 --> 00:22:15.480
Oh, my.

00:22:17.990 --> 00:22:19.290
I'm still hot.

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:20.900
Rinne.

00:22:24.560 --> 00:22:29.380
And I never got a chance to set 
things straight with Mamiya Sakura.

00:22:29.380 --> 00:22:31.010
Rinne-sama...

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:25.980
Next Episode:
  Just a Thank You

00:24:02.450 --> 00:24:04.120
Hey, Rinne, come here.

00:24:04.120 --> 00:24:04.760
What?

00:24:04.760 --> 00:24:06.310
Stomach Crack!

00:24:06.790 --> 00:24:09.920
What was that gut-punch attack for?

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:11.420
A woman's magazine said that

00:24:11.420 --> 00:24:15.410
the quickest way to a man's 
heart is through his stomach.

00:24:15.410 --> 00:24:20.220
Don't they mean that the quickest way to 
make a guy like you is to cook for him?

00:24:20.220 --> 00:24:23.690
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>: "Just a Thank You."

00:24:23.690 --> 00:24:25.980
Oh, yeah, bait!
